0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェノベーゼ！\nトマトソースとかゴルゴンゾーラとか\nレモンクリームとか...和風のとか\nんー全部すきっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかとさゆにゃんがラーメン\n食べ行ったら、どっちが食べ終わる\nの早いと思う？？ 笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すすれないけど、食べる早さは\n確実に私のが早いって笑！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前さゆにゃんがたい焼き\n食べてたんだけどあまりにちまちま\n食べるから無理やりガブっと..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら怒られちゃったー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな手帳を使っていますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手帳持ってけど、\nマメに書かないからほとんど\n使ってない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...シンプルなの使ってるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までどんなコスプレ\nしたことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーっと、バレリーナでしょ。\nツィギーでしょ、白熊でしょ、、\n↑これに関しては2ndの\n個人pv見てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとのごはん、\n誘う派?誘われる派?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誘うし、誘われるし...流れで\n行こうぜーいえーい\nみたいな感じだよ笑\n本当、仲良いよねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってるもの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホット豆乳！\n安定の豆乳です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きなこ黒ごまココア\nシナモンジンジャー...\n適当に混ぜてチンして夜飲んでる。\nホッとするよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n乃木ここの感想\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の朗読してから\nナレーションも楽しくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻声だったのは...ばれてないねうん←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！あのお弁当！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑あのお弁当"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で疑わられたけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝早く起きて頑張ったんだよー\n信じてよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママも手伝ってないよー\n真ん中のパスタはママが作ったけどー\nそれ以外は自分だよー←ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キッシュはずっと作って\nみたかったんだ！\nラップに包まれた物体は\n栗きんとん。これも手作り。\nちょっと焦げたピーマンとナスも\n味は問題なかったし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんのは弁当じゃなかったな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり私は\nやればできる子なんだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日がんばろー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみなさい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-53091":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ49JDJSB29T9EEFH20JAZN8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日「日経エンタテインメント！ 日向坂46 Special 2023」が発売されます😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしい衣装を着ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな色んな衣装を着て登場しているので是非チェックお願いします🥰‎🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#きずなーずでも撮影しました\n#またきずなーずやりたいな\n#出来たらいいな\n#京子ドラマ頑張ってるね\n#しっかりリアタイしました🫶🏻\n#がんばれ〜！！！"}],"source":"archive"}}